+
+	// Components that own geometry without owning a slot (shape volumes, splines) contribute their
+	// own bounds, so that framing (F), GetBoundBox and rubber-band selection see the geometry the
+	// user can see. An entity with no such component leaves the slot walk above untouched.
+	if (m_pEntity != nullptr)
